---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Snxhit">
  <section class="index-frame index-frame-interactive overflow-hidden">
    <div class="border-b border-zinc-800/90 px-4 py-3 sm:px-6">
      <h1 class="font-mono text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-200">[ About ]</h1>
      <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-400">Systems mindset. Graphics curiosity. Open-source shipping velocity.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-4 px-4 py-5 sm:px-6">
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300 sm:text-base">
        I build low-level software across systems programming, graphics rendering, networking, and tooling.
        My focus is designing clean architecture boundaries and writing code that stays debuggable as complexity grows.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300 sm:text-base">
        Most of my work lives in Rust and Go, where I iterate on compilers, kernels, protocol experiments, and rendering pipelines.
        I prefer transparent workflows, public build logs, and composable abstractions over monolithic frameworks.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-300 sm:text-base">
        The goal is simple: make technically ambitious projects feel maintainable, elegant, and useful to other builders.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  html.light .index-frame > .border-b {
    border-color: rgb(212 212 216 / 0.8);
  }

  html.light .index-frame h1 {
    color: rgb(39 39 42);
  }

  html.light .index-frame p {
    color: rgb(82 82 91);
  }
</style>
